{"id":67365,"date":"2025-11-01T21:03:41","date_gmt":"2025-11-01T20:03:41","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=67365"},"modified":"2026-10-19T12:43:32","modified_gmt":"2026-10-19T11:43:32","slug":"trail-falcao-real","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trail-falcao-real\/","title":{"rendered":"VII Trail do Falc\u00e3o Real 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">VII Trail do Falc\u00e3o Real 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">VII Trail do Falc\u00e3o Real 2026<\/strong> (7\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o) realiza-se no domingo, <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">13 de dezembro de 2026<\/strong>, com centro nevr\u00e1lgico, partida e chegada instalados junto ao <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Cais de Embarque de Alcoutim<\/strong>, nas margens do Rio Guadiana (distrito de Faro). O programa competitivo arranca \u00e0s <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">09:00<\/strong> com o <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Trail Longo de 32 km<\/strong> (<strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">1.500 m D+<\/strong>, limitado a 200 vagas), seguindo-se o <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Trail Sprint de 17 km<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">09:15<\/strong> (<strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">920 m D+<\/strong>, 400 vagas), o <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Mini Trail de 10 km<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">09:30<\/strong> (<strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">295 m D+<\/strong>), a <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Caminhada de 10 km<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">09:35<\/strong> e o <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Trail Kids<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">09:50<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Ao correres nos trilhos e cerros serranos do nordeste algarvio em <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Alcoutim<\/strong>, desfrutas de vistas panor\u00e2micas \u00edmpares sobre o vale do Baixo Guadiana e a vizinha localidade espanhola de Sanl\u00facar de Guadiana. A prova de <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">32 km<\/strong> (Grau 2 ATRP) disp\u00f5e de 3 postos de abastecimento e tempo limite de <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">6h30<\/strong> (com barreira hor\u00e1ria interm\u00e9dia ao km 17 \u00e0s 3h30 de prova), enquanto os <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">17 km<\/strong> (Grau 3 ATRP) t\u00eam limite de <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">4h00<\/strong> e o Mini Trail de <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">10 km<\/strong> disp\u00f5e de <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">3h30<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizada pela <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Sec\u00e7\u00e3o de Trail do Grupo Desportivo de Alcoutim<\/strong>, em parceria com a <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">C\u00e2mara Municipal de Alcoutim<\/strong>, a Uni\u00e3o das Freguesias de Alcoutim e Pereiro e parecer t\u00e9cnico da <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo do Algarve<\/strong>, a prova inclui dorsal com chip, brinde final, abastecimentos, seguro, banhos, refei\u00e7\u00e3o ligeira p\u00f3s-prova (sandes e bebida) e disponibiliza\u00e7\u00e3o gratuita de solo duro no Pavilh\u00e3o de Alcoutim mediante reserva pr\u00e9via. Consulta o calend\u00e1rio nacional de provas de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/trail\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Trail Running em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">13 de Dezembro de 2026<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255,